name=Chunk Load Sieve (performance patch)
id=ChunkLoadSieve
description=Unofficial performance patch. Several mods run a Lua handler on every square of every chunk that loads, mostly to look for one kind of object. This patch catches those handlers when they register and calls each one only on squares where it can do something (a generator, a gas pump, a container, mod data, and so on), from one shared handler instead of ten. Does not modify any other mod's files. Mods that are not installed are simply skipped.
modversion=1.2.0
versionMin=42.0.0
